  "details": "Groups/Guilds/Circles is on the list of things being implemented as we know. \n\nIt would be nice to \"request follow\" on certain users so that when they portal/change rooms/join on someone, your group also does so. \n\nSome things that would be necessary:\nThis list of followers can be confirmed for the leader. \nThe leader should be able to toggle friend followers on and off, from the social menu, under a heading like \"following you\" \n\nHave a menu toggle for \"confirm a follow\" so that you can choose to \"go with\" automatically (or not) when the event occurs.",
